  partName: Rear Blade Right
  description: The Rear Blade Right is a stationary blade located at the rear of
    the engine, similar to the Rear Blade Left, but positioned on the right side.
    It works in tandem with the Rear Blade Left to direct the flow of gases and maintain
    engine efficiency. Its shape and size are carefully optimized to maximize performance
    and minimize wear, and it is often paired with a corresponding shroud to prevent
    gas leaks.
